  "conclusion": "The connected components of the nonadditivity links after deleting one distinction are exactly the connected components of the physical incidence after deletion. Reject a marked separator or marks split by a separator. For other triples retain the connected bridge component and every incident boundary distinction. Restrict the scalar table to these identities. Original and local eligibility agree for every surviving triple. A full allowed-state transport preserves the three-parent verdict for whole presentations and for surviving candidates in genuinely retained pieces, even if no boundary distinction is marked. Width 22 refutes the retained three-row and local-parity test. At width 32 a full scalar table fails to determine all states even in a single retained part supporting eight legal triples. Its symmetries preserve the triple menu. The unrestricted full marked scalar inverse remains open.",
